ALAMO_BENCH 2
name space_battle_game
version 7
description One large game-made space battle for rendered runs: _MP_SPACE_KUAT, an idle Empire fleet against the Rebel AI, both with six times the default fleets (the AI side attacks and keeps reinforcing), saved with the fleets about to meet, then 1 min of battle under a camera that circles the fight
make --bench-map _MP_SPACE_KUAT --bench-human Empire --bench-ai Rebel --bench-scale 6 --bench-save-after 1000 --bench-seed 1
save space_battle_game.alsv 221576 5f3de7213fd110a6
orders space_battle_game.acmd 72 efa9479e9d3232fe
fingerprint space_battle_game.crc 31247 47db37b8f84e9844
fingerprint_every 16
start_tick 1022
ticks 1800
workers auto
final_crc c8baa9c5e1417ddd
host game
mode fixed
preset bm-high
frames_per_tick 2
camera 0 -2500 0 0 90 30 2600
camera 600 -2450 50 0 180 18 1500
camera 1200 -2500 0 0 270 28 1100
camera 1800 -2600 -100 0 360 40 2800
